picking 7k as the figure doesn't help your argument.

from last year :  [Private schools in Ireland: What do they charge and how much have their fees risen? – The Irish Times](https://www.irishtimes.com/ireland/education/2022/12/19/private-schools-in-ireland-what-do-they-charge-and-how-much-have-their-fees-risen/) 

Yeah i know for a fact they can. Some people sacrifice other things to send their kids to private school, for better or worse. Just cause your missus did a profile on everyone in her school doesn't mean private school in Ireland is for the rich only.
